  questionText:
  - language: English
    text: What is the main difference between D- and L-amino acids?
  - language: German
    text: "Worin besteht der Hauptunterschied zwischen D- und L-Aminos\xE4uren?"
  answers:
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: They differ in electric charge.
    - language: German
      text: Sie unterscheiden sich in ihrer elektrischen Ladung.
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: They differ in the spatial alignment of the atoms around the chiral carbon
        atom.
    - language: German
      text: "Sie unterscheiden sich in der r\xE4umlichen Anordnung der Atome am chiralen
        Kohlenstoffatom."
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: L-amino acids are hydrophilic and D-amino acids are hydrophobic.
    - language: German
      text: "L-Aminos\xE4uren sind hydrophil, D-Aminos\xE4uren hydrophob."
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: D-amino acids appear exclusively in human protein.
    - language: German
      text: "D-Aminos\xE4uren kommen ausschlie\xDFlich in Proteinen des Menschen
        vor."
  correctAnswer: 2
